Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:12.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:16.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上次這麼清靜 感覺都好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴去晨練跑步了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:23.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼去觀測飛機了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶今天開始要在唯美著迷打工
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1150,970)}Pretty Holic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.87,0:00:31.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶去馬術俱樂部了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:36.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都卯足了勁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:38.23,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,臻白！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:41.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是畫本 我們一起看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:43.84,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:49.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,經歷過種種 兩個人能夠幸福地生活下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可賀 可喜可賀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.74,0:00:53.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.39,0:00:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《灰姑娘》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《桃太郎》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:54.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,來！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這本也要看嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.86,0:00:58.16,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:01.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,發生過這樣的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.46,0:01:03.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可賀 可喜可賀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.47,0:01:04.37,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,來！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《將軍蓋帽貓的冒險》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.57,0:01:05.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:08.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一邊說 一邊逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.89,0:01:10.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可賀 可喜可賀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《小鬼的生日》《浦島太郎》《龜兔賽跑》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:11.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,來！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:14.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 都讀了10本了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:17.03,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,讀嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:22.43,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你都說讀了 來幾本就讀幾本吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:03:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}真白的夢想 最初的一步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.97,0:03:06.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,給公主讀了那麼多畫書嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:08.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喉嚨都有點啞了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:11.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學太溫柔了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:13.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,溫暖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:17.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 看到人了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:23.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶華
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:24.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喲！大伙都來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:30.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶華 你學習已經很忙了 還要打工
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:32.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有在強撐吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:36.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有！我早就想來這裡打工了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:39.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不要太開心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:40.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:44.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈 別太操心了 你又不是老媽子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:47.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這話應該我說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:49.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 這是新款的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:51.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮的顏色啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:57.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 塗上這個色 活力就能不輸給夏季耀眼的太陽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:04:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美妙的評價啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:01.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:02.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 菜摘姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小蝶的朋友嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得經常來逛我們店呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:08.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:14.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白是這裡的老粉絲了 所以致使我也會經常來逛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:17.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,唯美著迷是我的治癒聖地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:21.71,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,菜摘姐是我打工上的前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:25.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,現在正在上美院... 沒錯吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我在學習繪畫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 小白妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能幫我參考一下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:33.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:34.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這部分總覺得缺少一點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.49,0:04:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白妹妹是我們的老粉了 應該能想出點好主意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:46.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這幅畫是菜摘姐畫的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.75,0:04:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:50.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好美... 彷彿是人魚居住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.26,0:04:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人魚？或許效果會不錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:55.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:58.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:02.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼短時間 一下子就畫好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這畫得太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:08.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,給人一種使用了新款化妝品 就能化身人魚的感覺！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要有小白妹妹這種資質
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能得心應手地畫出畫書了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:19.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你說... 畫書嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正在挑戰那個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市大家的畫書大賽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是進展不太順利...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 小白妹妹要不要也試試看？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:29.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 不行的...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:32.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 不是挺有趣的嘛！小白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:33.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}家居中心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:37.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,創作畫書...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:41.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:42.84,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡也有！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:45.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要我參加嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.89,0:05:49.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學為我們做的雲麵包 可感動我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就像菜摘姐說的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:55.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學應該是有資質這樣東西的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:56.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸嘿嘿 有嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:02.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看看真白同學畫的畫書呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:04.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 這是我單方面的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:09.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我就嘗試挑戰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:11.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:13.20,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,畫畫！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:18.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 那個跟畫書沒什麼關係呢 想要嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:21.13,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.27,0:06:27.83,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:33.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就在這裡玩了 真白加油創作畫書吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:35.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,首先要構思故事...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:47.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 很久很久以前...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:51.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,山裡的小溪緩緩流淌...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:56.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,漂過來一隻很大 很大的桃子...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:07:00.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不對 這不就是桃太郎嗎 而且好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:03.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 不是桃子...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:06.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,從小溪上游... 漂來一隻南瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:09.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,從裡面蹦出一位漂亮的小姑娘...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.27,0:07:12.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不對 這成灰姑娘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,而且跟桃太郎混到一起了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個姐姐好像在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 是的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:21.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.18,0:07:25.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 我就是不行的吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:28.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,完全想不出故事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:31.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,也畫不出那麼精美的畫...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:34.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,說到底 我哪有什麼資質...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:41.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我替你做主意 好像讓真白同學困惱了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:44.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有 你能誇獎我 我挺開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:51.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只是... 我沒有大家那樣 想要從事某種職業的夢想...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:53.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:56.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:57.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:08:02.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還是認為真白同學保持現在這樣就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:04.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你不要去在意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 謝謝你 小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:11.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主 借一個給人家不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:16.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:19.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主的意思是 “絕對... 不借”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:20.94,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:25.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼小心眼 長大了可不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:28.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要友好相處哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:37.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我說啊 用小空你最喜歡的玩具\N\N跟小朋友一起玩的話 肯定會更開心的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:40.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:46.03,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:47.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家孩子給你們添麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:09:00.26,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:01.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:04.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:06.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我還遠不成熟啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:07.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道訓斥小空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:15.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,而真白同學卻在教導小空要有一顆友善的心...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:16.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.85,0:09:18.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有這回事的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:21.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,結果 小空也沒有明白這個道理...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:26.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,該怎麼辦才好呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 讀嘛 讀嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《浦島太郎》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的好的 我們從上次的地方接著讀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龍宮城 那是一座宏偉美麗的城池
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城裡的公主盛情款待了太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:47.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:48.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:51.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我先回去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:52.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:57.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真白... 她有什麼事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:05.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等著我 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:21.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 從白天開始就一直在畫畫書？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:25.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 都這麼沉浸其中了...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是第一次看見真白那個樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.01,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（壺哨聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.65,0:10:36.71,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,水開了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.73,0:10:41.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學沒有在勉強自己吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:46.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,來 小晴 這個拿好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:49.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你去看看小白的情況吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:52.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:57.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 我拿茶來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:01.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:04.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我進來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.73,0:11:17.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕地...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:20.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:21.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:25.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不知怎麼的... 心裡好開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:27.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:58.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,畫好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:02.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 要趕快了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:10.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哦喲 挺急的樣子...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.91,0:12:15.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是要辦什麼重要的事情吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.97,0:12:23.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,截稿是在什麼時候？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:26.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在5點前交到市民中心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.51,0:12:29.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,時間還早 沒問題的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:32.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:34.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:35.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢達！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:40.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵呵 那個資料袋裝的 是很重要的東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.55,0:12:42.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,與你無關！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:45.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我可擔心你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:51.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怕你們遇上什麼事故 怕你們把那資料袋掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.11,0:12:54.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:05.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:10.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 偏偏在這個時候！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:12.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個討厭的傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:13.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
