Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.22,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:12.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,給我上 亂暴獸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:14.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:18.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,信號燈是保護行人的工具！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.33,0:15:23.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,饒不了你用來搗亂的行為！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:24.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:25.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:27.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:28.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:29.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:30.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:33.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄氣闊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:35.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶撲擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:35.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Butterfly Press！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:38.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:40.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:43.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,身體不能動了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:44.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:46.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,連亂暴獸也停下了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.35,0:15:49.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:52.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:55.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:56.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:16:02.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:16:02.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:04.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:06.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:11.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,紅燈的時候 就不能動了...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.69,0:16:16.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,等到綠燈就能動了 只是我們掌握不了時機...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.15,0:16:18.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:20.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.20,0:16:23.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:24.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:26.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:30.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續糾纏下去 就趕不上畫書的截稿時間了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:32.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要管那個了 想辦法淨化亂暴獸...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:33.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼能不管！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:38.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism 等下一次綠燈的時候 你什麼都別想 只管往前衝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:40.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 那是你努力的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:43.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 現在情況緊急...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.53,0:16:44.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你只管去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:48.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism的溫柔 總是在背後扶持著我們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:52.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼今天 就讓我們為你助威！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:56.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:17:01.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,美麗啊... 多麼珍貴的友情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.51,0:17:03.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 你們無須煩惱了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:06.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,與其毫無成果的逐個擊破
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:09.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我就把你們一網打盡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:11.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧 亂暴獸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:15.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對了... Sky 準備上！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:16.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:25.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,二色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:27.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,紅色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:27.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:30.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黃色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:30.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:36.52,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,守護的力量飛揚起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:41.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:42.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.84,0:17:43.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:44.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,停住她！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.92,0:17:45.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:50.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:51.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:52.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:55.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好！這樣就沒辦法用紅燈了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:17:58.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！你快去！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:02.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:05.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:08.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我一記 綠燈行拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:08.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1070,960)}Let's GO Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:10.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:12.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,神采飛揚地上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:16.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,全色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:17.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合調色盤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:17.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mix Palette！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:19.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,紅色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:19.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:22.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黃色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:22.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:24.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:24.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:34.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,攪拌攪拌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:36.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,色彩填充！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:36.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Colour Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:19:00.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,光美·絢爛彩虹衝擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:19:00.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure Titanic Rainbow Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:07.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.23,0:19:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:13.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鏡平板！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:13.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirrorpad！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:21.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:26.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:30.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我為什麼會一次次輸給 這麼弱的傢伙們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:37.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄絕對不會輸給 你這種只會惹人厭的傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:39.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,行 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:43.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,徹底打垮你們的樂趣 我就留到下次了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢蜢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:49.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（鐘聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:58.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 真白！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:01.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！搞定了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:03.27,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,當然！小白呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:06.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,壓線趕上了 投稿成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:08.22,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.21,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市大家的畫書大賽展覽會場
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}大獎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:21.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:24.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這是唯美著迷的...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.73,0:20:27.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是菜摘姐的 太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:28.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好美...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.57,0:20:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白妹妹的畫書也很棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望以後我也能創作出 那種溫情的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:42.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,菜摘姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.79,0:20:47.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！這是真白同學的...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\frz8.619\pos(828,845)}{\fs50}《刺毛豪豬》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\frx180\fry180\frz6.084\pos(610,367)}{\fs50}《北極熊的暑假》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fad(0,500)}《鞦韆》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:56.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小姑娘在森林裡發現了大大的鞦韆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:58.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,盪啊盪 盪啊盪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:02.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這時候 來了一個小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.85,0:21:05.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.73,0:21:07.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:11.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小姑娘和小男孩一起盪起了鞦韆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.33,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:19.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,森林裡的動物們 一個接一個都過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:24.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家齊心協力 不斷地推動鞦韆...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:29.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了遠方那大大的彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:32.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都說 好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:35.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家已經是好朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:39.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,好 好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:40.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:42.95,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.11,0:21:45.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學就是厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:50.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然沒有入選大賽...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.05,0:21:54.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我以後也要嘗試多創作
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.91,0:22:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}虹丘真白 作品《鞦韆》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:59.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,畫出能夠傳達到小空 傳達到小朋友心裡的畫書...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:04.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:09.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Melody！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:09.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1080,970)}旋律愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.42,0:22:11.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 和我一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:12.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,奏響音樂！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:12.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Let's play！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.07,0:23:47.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起外出玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:50.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 還有在養護菜田的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.62,0:23:53.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像還是第一次採摘蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.46,0:23:57.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 奶奶急著要出門 還真是少見呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.91,0:23:59.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:00.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:00.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,雄闊振翅！知識之翼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:25.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:30.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.18,0:01:36.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:44.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:49.40,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:53.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.66,0:01:55.12,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:59.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:04.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.09,0:02:05.96,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:10.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.93,0:02:14.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:17.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:17.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.89,0:02:19.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.29,0:02:19.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.27,0:02:25.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:30.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:35.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:40.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.75,0:02:43.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:51.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.05,0:22:29.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:34.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:37.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:38.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.87,0:22:41.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:44.17,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.17,0:22:46.13,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.13,0:22:48.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:51.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:53.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:22:55.93,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:02.50,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.21,0:23:08.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:10.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.38,0:23:15.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.05,0:23:19.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.31,0:23:25.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:29.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:33.82,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.82,0:23:37.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:38.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.91,0:23:41.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
